      "id": 9000,
      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;border-left:3px solid #B77D34;padding:8px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:2px\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#d8d9da\">INFINIBAND &mdash; FABRIC OVERVIEW &amp; HEALTH SCORECARD</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9aa0a6;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5\">The UFM-side view of the fabric: switch and link inventory from the <code>ib-identity</code> and <code>ib-switch-audit</code> collectors, per-switch reachability from <code>ib-switch-live</code> and <code>ib-lldp</code>, and alarms, events and port state from the UFM REST collector. <b>The collector-endpoint tiles below are live</b> and read <code>up{plane=\"ib\"}</code> directly &mdash; they tell you whether the rest of this board has a producer right now. Host-side IB telemetry is on <i>InfiniBand Fabric &mdash; HCA Telemetry Coverage</i>; the Quantum-3 switch fleet is on <i>InfiniBand Switches &mdash; Quantum-3 Fleet</i>.</div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
